CONCLUSION (conditional on F1-F3): every primitive 12-family W with
M(W) < 452/5864 = 1/13 + 3/19058, max(W) <= 258276, and not 11-of-12
even speeds, satisfies W = {1,...,12}.  In particular the micro-gap
(1/13, 452/5864) contains no such family, and tight-locus rigidity
holds to height 258276 on this branch -- vs height ~200 by prior
exhaustion (kps-S1).
